---
description: Bind assignment commitment to contributor acceptance of exact terms.
args:{brief:IssueBrief;assessments:PitchAssessment[];commissions:Commission[]}
returns:Commission[]
---
For each offered assignment compare accepted terms revision with its current angle, scope, length, duties, rights and deadline. Promote only an exact accepted revision to accepted state. A decline or changed term remains uncommitted and is returned for negotiation. If access disappears, identify the failed dependency and require a revised reporting plan before work advances.
